# Mystical Tether at sorcery speed (CR 601.2b, 601.2f, 118.8). With five mana in hand (three Mox Pearls and a Mox Jet and Mox
# Ruby) the question "Flash: Pay {2} more" is asked, though nothing needs it (the rulings allow it): on turn 3 Bot1 pays it,
# all five Moxen tapped for the {2}{W}{2}, and the mana value is still three (CR 202.3). On turn 5 the second Tether is cast
# for {2}{W} alone: the extra is declined and the Mox Jet and Mox Ruby stay untapped. Each exiles one of Bot2's two Moxen.

